WEBVTT

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:18.980
You should stay here until the Fortune Cup.

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:24.150
It doesn't have much furniture for a 
condominium, but it has the bare essentials.

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:25.740
Ask if you want anything.

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:27.740
It's plenty.  Thanks.

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:30.860
I'm the one who should be apologizing.

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:38.510
The marker is used for emergency situations, 
so Security knows your location.

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:41.490
That doesn't bother me.

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:46.060
You really have guts.

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:23.410
No matter how far apart we 
are, we can't be stopped

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:28.410
That's deeply engraved into us

00:01:28.590 --> 00:01:36.950
So don't be afraid of getting hurt

00:01:39.370 --> 00:01:42.950
Break through even further

00:01:43.310 --> 00:01:48.420
While carrying you beliefs in your heart

00:01:49.950 --> 00:01:55.570
There's always only one truth

00:01:55.790 --> 00:01:59.460
So feel the voice of your heart

00:02:00.730 --> 00:02:04.250
With your unwavering emotions

00:02:04.730 --> 00:02:10.350
Seize the signs of tomorrow

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:45.720
Folklore Appears Black Rose 
Witch Brings Destruction

00:02:49.290 --> 00:02:50.620
What?

00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:53.600
He's not here!

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:55.650
Lua, what's going on?

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:56.990
Luca!

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:59.540
Yusei's not here!

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:01.930
Like I thought, he left.

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:06.150
Why did he leave?

00:03:06.150 --> 00:03:07.760
It's because you said those things, Luca!

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:09.740
Don't blame me.

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:11.450
Where did you go, Yusei?

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:11.630
But more importantly, look at this.

00:03:12.530 --> 00:03:14.240
It's lighter.

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:17.820
Look!  It fits me perfectly!

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:22.070
He altered them so that it would fit us.

00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:25.560
He's awesome.  He can do anything.

00:03:27.630 --> 00:03:29.760
What a mysterious person.

00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:34.010
I wish I could have talked 
to him a little more…

00:03:34.010 --> 00:03:36.000
But it's too late to think like that now.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:40.960
It is too late.  Luca, you were 
really wary of Yusei yesterday.

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:46.880
Good morning, Lua.

00:03:47.250 --> 00:03:49.160
Tenpei, you're early!

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:52.000
I hope you didn't forget today's appointment!

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:53.440
Umm…

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:54.980
About the Black Rose Witch!

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:59.130
Oh yeah.  We're going to the 
Daimon Area to defeat the witch.

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:01.230
Will you two be okay?

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:03.730
The witch is a powerful duelist, right?

00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:06.900
The rumors say that the witch 
makes the loser disappear.

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:08.150
We'll be fine!

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:11.950
I've constructed the strongest 
deck to defeat the witch.

00:04:11.990 --> 00:04:13.510
Awesome.

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:17.360
Witnesses posted the witch's 
deck on the Internet.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:21.090
I analyzed it and made a deck 
that definitely won't lose.

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:23.010
I'll do it too!

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:26.140
Isn't that different than the usual one?

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:30.070
Yup.  My Duel Disk was "cusmotized."

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:32.300
You mean "customized."

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:36.300
What do you mean?  I didn't know 
you knew how to do that, Lua.

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:39.410
I met an incredible person yesterday.

00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:40.180
Wait!

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:43.840
What are you thinking!  
Yusei is being pursued!

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:45.120
Oh yeah.

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:47.040
What is it, Luca?

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:54.510
Umm, we haven't eaten breakfast yet, 
so we'll call you after we eat.

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:56.880
Don't say anything about Yusei.

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:02.350
I want to meet Yusei one more time.

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:11.110
I bet the D-Wheel isn't the only reason

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:14.610
why the Public Maintenance Department 
is keeping their eye on you.

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:30.850
Your friends?

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:32.380
In Satellite.

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:35.920
If I don't enter the Fortune 
Cup, they're in danger.

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:38.100
Isn't that a threat?

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:42.950
Do you know why they're 
going so far to target you?

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:44.590
No.

00:05:45.060 --> 00:05:46.690
I see.

00:05:48.390 --> 00:05:50.920
Can I borrow this?

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:55.330
I'll investigate how they're currently doing.

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:57.810
You have connections in Satellite?

00:05:57.980 --> 00:06:00.290
I'm a guy who can do anything.

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:04.640
Besides, this is your bond, right?

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:17.190
Are you prepared for the Fortune Cup?

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:19.840
It's a lame event.

00:06:20.070 --> 00:06:22.240
That's not true.

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:26.190
I have invited one additional 
entrant for the King.

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:27.120
What?

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:29.400
A man from Satellite.

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:32.440
Yusei?  Why?

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:36.570
I need you to quench your thirst.

00:06:37.110 --> 00:06:41.880
I must now leave because I have 
work to do for the Fortune Cup.

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:44.540
You don't need to see me out.

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:52.380
He's coming.

00:06:53.570 --> 00:06:55.840
What is the director planning?

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:58.420
I haven't heard anything.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:03.150
Quench my thirst…

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:22.250
Where are you going, Master Atlas?

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:28.110
The Fortune Cup is going to be a bigger 
stage for the King than even the director thinks.

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:33.450
The King will also subdue the Crimson Dragon!

00:07:56.970 --> 00:07:58.970
You have guests!

00:08:01.970 --> 00:08:04.450
It's Yanagi!

00:08:04.680 --> 00:08:06.870
How are you?

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:08.300
Himuro.

00:08:08.530 --> 00:08:10.260
Surprised to see them?

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:12.760
Bro, thanks to you, we were able to leave.

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:15.900
They even rescinded the 
half year of forced labor.

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:19.990
It's good to have a strong 
duelist as a friend!

00:08:19.990 --> 00:08:24.590
The director must have arranged this for you 
because you won the unfair duel against Takasu.

00:08:24.590 --> 00:08:26.410
Thanks.

00:08:27.430 --> 00:08:30.050
So this is your D-Wheel.

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:34.240
I heard from Saiga that you 
retrieved it from Security.

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:36.180
You're an incredible guy.

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:40.510
Because you're able to find a way out 
of any bad situation with your cards.

00:08:40.510 --> 00:08:43.130
You're an excellent duelist.

00:08:43.730 --> 00:08:46.730
So this is your deck?

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:50.800
How about it, Yusei?  Why don't 
you duel me with your own deck.

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:53.390
I want to see that too!

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:05.390
I wish you could have seen it.

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:11.490
At the detention center, Bro used my deck 
against Himuro  It felt so good when he won.

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:14.880
Himuro said that it's called the Wonder Deck?

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:17.010
No, it's called the Treasure Deck!

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:19.110
Do you want to see it?  Here!

00:09:19.110 --> 00:09:21.210
This is Crystal Skull!

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:24.700
You really are a strange individual.

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:23.960
And this is Ashoka Pillar!

00:09:25.150 --> 00:09:30.260
It's not often that someone as rebellious 
as Himuro becomes your friend.

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:27.710
Aren't they great?

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:33.490
And this grandpa trusts you completely.

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:36.270
Well, you can say the same about me.

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:38.870
Duel!

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:46.770
Jack.

00:09:46.780 --> 00:09:48.420
King!

00:10:26.530 --> 00:10:29.030
Why is the King here?

00:10:29.030 --> 00:10:30.500
I don't know.

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:39.510
I didn't think I'd meet you again, King.

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:49.030
What do you want?

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:55.610
Is that the dragon?

00:10:55.610 --> 00:10:58.130
I heard you're entering at the Fortune Cup.

00:10:58.130 --> 00:10:59.490
How did you know?

00:10:59.490 --> 00:11:03.460
That doesn't matter.  I came 
to give this back to you.

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:07.600
It makes sense for you to use Stardust.

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:11.040
Use it so that we can settle 
things from that night.

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:14.590
So you were the one who sold 
out Rally and my friends.

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:16.060
What?

00:11:19.510 --> 00:11:24.490
A man from the Public Maintenance 
Department brought me this photo.

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:29.700
If I don't enter the Fortune Cup, Rally 
and my friends will be in danger.

00:11:30.280 --> 00:11:34.390
The reason I'm entering is so that I can fight 
against the corrupt Public Maintenance Department.

00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:38.420
Then you really should hold on to Stardust.

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:43.740
That's everything.

00:11:43.940 --> 00:11:48.600
I came here this time.  
Next time, you come to me.

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:57.210
Let me say one thing.

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:02.680
The Crimson Dragon you saw that 
day is only the beginning.

00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:04.020
What?

00:12:16.640 --> 00:12:18.990
Show me the dragon!

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:23.920
Finally!  It's called 
Stardust Dragon?  How cool!

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:27.470
Bro, this means you're a Signer.

00:12:29.370 --> 00:12:34.080
Was the person you were dueling that night…

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:35.540
It was him.

00:12:35.780 --> 00:12:38.380
The King?  How shocking!

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:40.940
Then the King is also a Signer?

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:52.930
Yusei, you haven't changed.

00:12:53.560 --> 00:12:56.040
You really are a Satellite.

00:12:57.650 --> 00:13:02.560
But Yusei, how long are you going 
to stay in that closed world?

00:13:02.890 --> 00:13:05.320
Now that Stardust is in your hands,

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:09.120
all the requirements needed to prove 
that I'm the true King have been met.

00:13:09.460 --> 00:13:13.240
I will defeat you and 
acquire even greater power!

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:33.520
The traveling stars will soon strengthen 
the brightness of our dragon star.

00:13:33.890 --> 00:13:38.830
You will all give all your souls to Iliaster.

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:43.170
You are duel assassins who pledged 
your faith to the people of the stars.

00:13:43.540 --> 00:13:49.770
Feed on the power of the stars so that you 
can expose the people who have the dragon marks.

00:13:50.870 --> 00:13:54.760
Everything we do is for the coming hour...

00:14:18.280 --> 00:14:20.210
Pull it together!

00:14:20.300 --> 00:14:22.280
I win!

00:14:23.730 --> 00:14:25.070
Yusei.

00:14:25.620 --> 00:14:29.370
I made preparations so that I can sneak 
into Satellite.  I'm leaving tonight.

00:14:29.370 --> 00:14:31.620
I'm surprised.  You shouldn't 
be able to travel

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:33.730
back and forth between 
the City and Satellite.

00:14:33.730 --> 00:14:35.370
Officially, you can't.

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:37.470
However, there's a system 
where garbage leaves here

00:14:37.470 --> 00:14:39.810
to be recycled and returned, so there 
are work boats that do the job.

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:42.380
I've arranged it so that 
I can get on board a boat.

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:46.170
No wonder they say you're a 
Jack-of-all-trades.  There's nothing you can't do.

00:14:46.170 --> 00:14:50.250
I can do it because everyone in 
this area has their own needs.

00:14:51.100 --> 00:14:55.080
It's true that we won't be noticed here.

00:14:55.100 --> 00:14:57.540
Since they have a marker, 
they can't go to the City.

00:14:57.540 --> 00:14:59.800
But they also don't want 
to fall to Satellite.

00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:03.530
This is the area where these 
people gather and live.

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:14.250
Leave Satellite to me so that you 
can wreak havoc at the Fortune Cup.

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:20.380
Mister?

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:22.850
Have you dueled against the witch before?

00:15:23.530 --> 00:15:27.140
Stop joking about the witch!  
Hurry up and go home!

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:29.650
Maybe no one has seen her before.

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:33.370
But if everyone knows about her, 
then she's definitely here.

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:36.740
True.  I hope the witch shows up soon.

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:40.060
I have faith in this deck.

00:15:40.060 --> 00:15:44.920
But they say that the witch's 
power is no ordinary power.

00:15:47.820 --> 00:15:52.680
They say that when the witch's monster 
attacks, the ground actually shakes.

00:15:52.870 --> 00:15:57.980
They say that when she activates a 
trap or spell, it actually happens.

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:03.150
So the story about her making people 
disappear might also be true.

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:05.570
Are you scared, Tenpei?

00:16:05.570 --> 00:16:07.520
I'm not scared!

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:09.000
Yusei!

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:10.120
Yusei!

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:15.220
Tenpei, come over here!  He's the 
guy who "cusmotized" this Duel Disk!

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:17.840
Don't you mean "customize?"

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:20.620
Yusei, you came here too?

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:22.340
What are you doing here?

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:26.080
This isn't a place for children.  
What happened to Luca?

00:16:26.090 --> 00:16:28.150
She's home alone.

00:16:29.810 --> 00:16:32.090
Hey Lua, that's…

00:16:32.310 --> 00:16:34.250
That's a marker.

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:36.460
But he did this for me.

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:38.330
Who are you kids?

00:16:38.800 --> 00:16:40.990
Are you all Yusei's friends?

00:16:41.170 --> 00:16:44.950
Yeah.  He's the child from Tops who hid me.

00:16:45.050 --> 00:16:48.160
I'm Lua!  And this is my friend Tenpei.

00:16:48.160 --> 00:16:49.570
H-Hello.

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:53.390
Tenpei, this is a good opportunity 
to get Yusei to duel you.

00:16:53.390 --> 00:16:55.130
He's really strong.

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:00.500
Isn't that...?

00:17:01.800 --> 00:17:05.040
Yusei, that's an invitation 
to the Fortune Cup!

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:06.510
Are you also entering, Yusei?

00:17:06.510 --> 00:17:07.030
Yes.

00:17:07.090 --> 00:17:10.380
Hooray!  I'll be able to duel Yusei again!

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:12.890
Yusei, I won't lose ever again.

00:17:12.930 --> 00:17:18.290
See, Tenpei?  Yusei is an incredible duelist 
who has the skills to enter the Fortune Cup!

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:23.540
Yusei, what's wrong?

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:24.740
Bro!

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:26.380
It's the same as last time.

00:17:26.380 --> 00:17:27.990
Last time?

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:32.400
The time the Crimson Dragon appeared.

00:17:33.220 --> 00:17:34.420
It's the witch!

00:17:34.890 --> 00:17:35.770
The witch?

00:17:35.770 --> 00:17:37.600
She really showed up?  Where?

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:38.270
It's the witch!

00:17:38.270 --> 00:17:39.970
She'll make us disappear!  Run!

00:17:39.970 --> 00:17:42.080
Guys, wait!

00:17:45.070 --> 00:17:46.160
A witch?

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:47.570
She's here?

00:17:47.570 --> 00:17:48.370
She?

00:17:48.370 --> 00:17:51.010
Let's escape before we get dragged into this.

00:18:04.740 --> 00:18:06.110
Dragon…

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:10.090
The mark is…

00:18:10.090 --> 00:18:10.730
Bro.

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:12.900
Did you have that before?

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:16.640
That's the symbol of a Signer.  
It's the mark of the dragon.

00:18:18.620 --> 00:18:20.780
Mark of the dragon?

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:36.150
What's that monster?

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:38.830
Yusei!

00:18:56.770 --> 00:18:58.180
The witch.

00:18:58.180 --> 00:19:00.790
That's the witch.

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:10.380
The Black Rose Witch…  She really exists.

00:19:10.380 --> 00:19:12.360
Wow!

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:22.800
You too?

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:27.960
“You too?”

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:33.730
It's a detestable mark!

00:19:57.750 --> 00:19:58.840
She's gone.

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:01.800
What just happened?  If she was a hologram,

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:05.100
how was she able to blow us away 
with the power of a spell card?

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:07.400
She really exists!

00:20:07.400 --> 00:20:09.990
Thank goodness that she 
didn't make us disappear.

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:17.110
The witch's reaction when 
she saw you was interesting.

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:21.490
It vanished.

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:24.370
Why?  What a waste!

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:27.270
That witch probably also has the mark.

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:32.740
The witch said, “You too.”

00:21:21.110 --> 00:21:27.150
Last night, the witch appeared 
in the Daimon Area again.

00:21:27.150 --> 00:21:33.170
Since the witch also received an invitation, 
we'll get to see what she looks like soon.

00:21:36.670 --> 00:21:41.970
The Signers will gather under the 
protection of the dragon star.

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:10.000
What can we grasp?  What can we do?

00:22:10.360 --> 00:22:15.390
We'll step forward and find out

00:22:15.760 --> 00:22:21.310
My unstoppable emotions, the 
beating of my passionate heart

00:22:21.470 --> 00:22:26.550
I heard the voice of truth

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:29.710
After I was hurt, I learned

00:22:32.280 --> 00:22:35.300
Of a place where I can become stronger

00:22:37.250 --> 00:22:42.460
I stack my dreams in my palm

00:22:42.590 --> 00:22:47.860
And I'll someday pass them to you

00:22:48.290 --> 00:22:53.800
Seeking for the signal 
to start, my soul roars

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:59.140
I will overcome my suffocating 
and mediocre life

00:22:59.700 --> 00:23:05.230
I'll dash and acquire all the bright futures

00:23:05.380 --> 00:23:14.650
Carrying the bonds I believe 
in, I run towards tomorrow
